# skills + manual-targeting: the name bar lists everything that ails the highlighted enemy. Jian alone
# (level index 8), first temple battle, with ailments poked into the stat records (0x0228E860 + 0x6C * n:
# status low nibble +0x08, ATK stage +0x40, DEF stage +0x42): the skeleton (9) ATK and DEF lowered and
# poisoned, the spider (10) DEF lowered, back-row 4 ATK lowered and asleep, back-row 5 paralyzed.
# Fight's grid: "Thanatos ATKvDEFvPsn" (shot tg_all, v = the down triangle), "Tick DEFv" (tg_def).
# Weapon Break's grid: "Bealzebub ATKvSlp" (tg_sleep), "Bealzebub Par" (tg_par), and no tag on the third
# (tg_none). Run with --save.
# Since the lists are in learn order (2026-11-18) Stone Throw is the first entry, so the plan presses Down
# or Right once more to reach its skill.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 8
wait 270
poke u16 0x0228EC6C 0xFFFF
poke u16 0x0228EC6E 0xFFFF
poke u8 0x0228EC34 6
poke u16 0x0228ECDA 0xFFFF
poke u16 0x0228EA50 0xFFFF
poke u8 0x0228EA18 1
poke u8 0x0228EA84 4
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot tg_all
press Right 8
wait 30
shot tg_def
press B 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 80
shot tg_sleep
press Right 8
wait 20
shot tg_par
press Right 8
wait 20
shot tg_none
